r kitchen floor will be **$2400**.", "decode_seconds": 7.529701083898544, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 82, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "a5d8a03eb84fa0dfbe532a14cddbd199f8ae387a5cfc71dbcf317c03e67f2e25", "output_tokens": 289, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20510953472, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20862468096, "problem_id": "gsm8k/5c57a1aa62adbafa", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 7563.541629817337}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "2400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 7.563541629817337, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20862468096, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20862468096, "sampling_seed": 4811778872125368873, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 289, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.032503669150173664, "turn_index": 0}
{"acceptance_length": 5.711538461538462, "acceptance_lengths": [2, 2, 1, 4, 1, 7, 2, 2, 3, 3, 1, 4, 3, 3, 4, 2, 14, 5, 1, 10, 12, 1, 14, 5, 5, 6, 1, 2, 5, 4, 2, 1, 14, 9, 11, 12, 15, 6, 4, 2, 4, 16, 6, 8, 10, 2, 8, 4, 13, 3, 14, 4], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 20455006208, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 20454988800, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "Let's break this problem down step by step.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Understand the dimensions of the tiles**\n\nEach tile is square with a side length of **1 foot**.  \nSo, the area of **one tile** is:\n\n$$\n\\text{Area of one tile} = 1\\ \\text{ft} \\times 1\\ \\text{ft} = 1\\ \\text{sq ft}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Calculate the number of tiles needed**\n\nThe total area of the kitchen floor is **200 square feet**.  \nSince each tile covers **1 square foot**, you will need:\n\n$$\n\\text{Number of tiles} = \\frac{200\\ \\text{sq ft}}{1\\ \\text{sq ft per tile}} = 200\\ \\text{tiles}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Calculate the total cost**\n\nEach tile costs **$12**.  \nSo the total cost is:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total cost} = 200\\ \\text{tiles} \\times 12\\ \\text{\\$/tile} = 2400\\ \\text{\\$}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n$$\n\\boxed{2400}\n$$\n\nSo, the cost to renovate the kitchen floor is **$2400**.", "decode_seconds": 1.8801771267317235, "draft_calls": 52, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 82, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "9bbbcb70a478a6a9b60be15321989bedf188f41819e98426029515182b23492a", "output_tokens": 296, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20550337024, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20862468096, "problem_id": "gsm8k/5c57a1aa62adbafa", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 1919.4338619709015}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "2400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 1.9194338619709015, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20862468096, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20862468096, "sampling_seed": 4811778872125368873, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 52, "