{"acceptance_length": 5.155172413793103, "acceptance_lengths": [3, 1, 3, 3, 4, 11, 6, 10, 1, 1, 1, 3, 4, 7, 2, 4, 6, 8, 3, 1, 9, 16, 6, 2, 8, 11, 2, 3, 10, 1, 1, 15, 15, 4, 1, 6, 2, 2, 5, 13, 9, 2, 3, 1, 4, 10, 3, 1, 11, 2, 6, 13, 2, 2, 2, 4, 5, 5], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 20455006208, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 20454988800, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are told that:\n\n- The firefighters' **goal** is to raise **$6300**.\n- After **3 hours**, they have raised **$2100**.\n- They raise **the same amount every hour**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Find the amount raised per hour\n\n$$\n\\text{Amount raised per hour} = \\frac{\\text{Total raised after 3 hours}}{\\text{Number of hours}} = \\frac{2100}{3} = 700\n$$\n\nSo, they raise **$700 per hour**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Find how much more money is needed to reach the goal\n\n$$\n\\text{Remaining amount} = 6300 - 2100 = 4200\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find how many more hours are needed\n\n$$\n\\text{Number of additional hours required} = \\frac{4200}{700} = 6\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Find the total number of hours needed\n\n$$\n\\text{Total hours} = 3 \\text{ (already passed)} + 6 \\text{ (additional)} = 9\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{9}\n$$\n\nThey need to fundraise for **9 hours in total** to reach their goal.", "decode_seconds": 2.1052566608414054, "draft_calls": 58, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 94, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "53aa4b5c9dde300c5001baf70c8b8ebf6f00bee2a7de1fb71dde5afb1e757360", "output_tokens": 298, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20552520192, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20862468096, "problem_id": "gsm8k/5b7f6f1902a383b9", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 2145.0549149885774}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "9", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 2.1450549149885774, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20862468096, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20862468096, "sampling_seed": 4830382049163374866, "sampling_temperatu